  "description": "Do-Ha never expected to run into his childhood crush, Hwa-Soo, again. Turns out he's living right next door. But wait, he’s married? And has a daughter? Maybe this isn’t meant to be. No, scratch that. He’s divorced. Sweeeett!! Looks like fate just handed Do-Ha a second chance. And damn, Hwa-Soo still looks amazing. That quiet sadness makes him even more irresistible. Divorced? Older? Doesn’t matter. Do-Ha isn’t backing down. He’s not just the kid from the past. This time, he’s going after what he wants.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
